{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"faction_dailies/menus/13010535_1_4.jp.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"faction_dailies/menu_13010535:1:4","lang":"jp","texts":{"menu:6058730:1":{"text":"シーッ、静かにしろ。魚が逃げちまうだろ！","source_cn":"嘘，小声点，别打扰我钓鱼！","status":"exact_duplicate_same"}},"speakers":{"speaker:钓鱼客":{"text":"釣り人","source":"钓鱼客","status":"exact_hash"}}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13225340.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13225340","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13225340","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322534001:1":{"text":"長く働いてくれている衛兵に労いの意を込めて、何か美味しいものをご馳走したいと思っているのですが。","source_cn":"侍卫们已经连续工作许久了，我总想着弄点好吃的慰劳一下大家。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x07FA97093A765950","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"長く働いてくれている衛兵に労いの意を込めて、何か美味しいものをご馳走したいと思っているのですが。","female":"長く働いてくれている衛兵に労いの意を込めて、何か美味しいものをご馳走したいと思っているのですが。","variant_male_record_index":"151900","variant_female_record_index":"151901","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322534002:1":{"text":"以前、衛兵たちはよく休日に釣りに出かけ、市場では手に入らない新鮮な魚を釣って食べていました……","source_cn":"我记得以前侍卫们在假日里会一起约着钓鱼，钓上来的鱼比市...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x283F16F01C27BE46","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"以前、衛兵たちはよく休日に釣りに出かけ、市場では手に入らない新鮮な魚を釣って食べていました……","female":"以前、衛兵たちはよく休日に釣りに出かけ、市場では手に入らない新鮮な魚を釣って食べていました……","variant_male_record_index":"151902","variant_female_record_index":"151903","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322534003:1":{"text":"メイジ殿、お時間があればでいいのですが……衛兵たちのために魚を釣ってきてくれませんか？私も新鮮な魚が恋しくて。","source_cn":"魔法师大人，如果您有空的话，能为侍卫们钓几条鱼吗？就算...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFC86013D660EDC1A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"メイジ殿、お時間があればでいいのですが……衛兵たちのために魚を釣ってきてくれませんか？私も新鮮な魚が恋しくて。","female":"メイジ殿、お時間があればでいいのですが……衛兵たちのために魚を釣ってきてくれませんか？私も新鮮な魚が恋しくて。","variant_male_record_index":"151904","variant_female_record_index":"151905","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:侍卫长罗德里戈":{"text":"護衛隊長のロドリゴ","source":"侍卫长罗德里戈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13225350.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13225350","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13225350","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1322535001:0":{"text":"魚です！あそこにたくさんいますよ！","source_cn":"好多鱼！满满看到了鱼了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CCCAA6F6BA13164","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13225360.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13225360","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13225360","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322536001:1":{"text":"マスター、おこがましいのですが……この魚、ちょっと小さくないですか？","source_cn":"主人，可能满满有点多嘴，感觉这鱼还是不够大？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCFE3C7BED14FA151","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスター、おこがましいのですが……この魚、ちょっと小さくないですか？","female":"マスター、おこがましいのですが……この魚、ちょっと小さくないですか？","variant_male_record_index":"151907","variant_female_record_index":"151908","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322536002:1":{"text":"他にポイントがあるのかもしれません、周りの釣り人に聞いてみましょう。","source_cn":"是不是咱们钓点找错了，要不咱问问周围钓鱼的人吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF525FDFA58E0575E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13225370.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13225370","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13225370","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322537001:0":{"text":"大物がいるポイント？ふーん……あんたみたいなやつってよくいるよな。釣れないのをポイントのせいにしてよ。","source_cn":"鱼又大又多的钓点？哦……我总能遇上你们这样的，鱼不多不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37A31B5E29A574D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322537002:0":{"text":"まぁ、静かな場所に行ってみるのはどうだ？遺跡の花畑なんか、大物が釣れるって聞いたことがあるぜ。","source_cn":"不过人越少去的地方鱼越大嘛，我听说遗迹花海那边倒是不错...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDDBE85DC405F7A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322537003:0":{"text":"でも、ここからはちょっと遠いから、道中には気を付けろよ。","source_cn":"不过路途遥远，你们要过去的话路上可要注意安全啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4448CE4506CD30BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:钓鱼客":{"text":"釣り人","source":"钓鱼客","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13225380.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13225380","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13225380","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1322538001:0":{"text":"遺跡の花畑に着きました！ここがそのポイントではないですか！？","source_cn":"遗迹花海的钓点！应该就是这里了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x754A181BF664B192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13225390.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13225390","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13225390","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1322539001:0":{"text":"すごい大物です！よく肥えていて、これなら文句ないですよ！","source_cn":"好大的鱼！肥美的鱼！这下应该没问题了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81F95046AC9D6D7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1322539002:0":{"text":"今すぐロンロンが食べたいくらいです……！","source_cn":"别说侍卫，满满都馋了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FE2A210A4F3B0E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep3/quest_story/13225400.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13225400","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13225400","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322540001:1":{"text":"これは信じられない……ここまで肥えた魚は私も見たことがありません。","source_cn":"有些难以置信，侍卫们从来没钓上来过这么肥美的鱼。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x42FC2A5A1F6A80F5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"これは信じられない……ここまで肥えた魚は私も見たことがありません。","female":"これは信じられない……ここまで肥えた魚は私も見たことがありません。","variant_male_record_index":"151916","variant_female_record_index":"151917","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322540002:1":{"text":"長い間まともな食事をとれていなかったので、この魚を見たら衛兵たちも大喜びでしょう。","source_cn":"侍卫们好久没有好好吃一顿了，相信他们见到这些鱼也会很高兴。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC4B46D22A8084373","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"長い間まともな食事をとれていなかったので、この魚を見たら衛兵たちも大喜びでしょう。","female":"長い間まともな食事をとれていなかったので、この魚を見たら衛兵たちも大喜びでしょう。","variant_male_record_index":"151918","variant_female_record_index":"151919","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322540003:1":{"text":"本当にありがとうございました。","source_cn":"十分感谢您。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF3A07C0E524D3611","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"本当にありがとうございました。","female":"本当にありがとうございました。","variant_male_record_index":"151920","variant_female_record_index":"151921","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:侍卫长罗德里戈":{"text":"護衛隊長のロドリゴ","source":"侍卫长罗德里戈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}},"optional_activities/locales/jp/13010535/1/1.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010535:1:1","lang":"jp","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"optional_activities/locales/jp/13010535/1/2.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010535:1:2","lang":"jp","texts":{},"speakers":{}},"optional_activities/locales/jp/13010535/1/3.json":{"schema_version":1,"asset_key":"optional/objective_13010